WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
Hello, I am Miss Chandana Ghimire. I teach in Brindavan Boarding School as economics

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:12.320
and geography teacher. I have been teaching here for three years as of now.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:22.760
Okay, we can continue. The thing which I like the most about my school here is

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:29.640
that the school is very much secured and it is installed with around 45 to 47

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:35.240
cameras, checking on each and every student in their classroom and in the surrounding.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:39.920
Not only that, it also has a very well equipped fire extinguisher in each and every corner

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:46.760
of the school so that we are well aware about any fire outbreak that takes place or that

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.160
is likely to occur in the near future.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:53.840
And the next important thing that I would like to share is that Brindavan Bowling School

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.560
is the most disciplined school in and around Middletown,

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:00.440
and it is well known for its discipline,

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:05.440
as our director, sir, is very much firm about emphasizing

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.380
or imposing a very strict disciplinary action

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.400
on every and all the student.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.240
Thank you.
